  "description": "Dear Team,\n\nPlease note that the PDF Manager template we will be using for the upcoming review cycle is identified by ID\u202f2 and can be accessed via the endpoint **/api/v1/user_identities/1/pdf_manager_templates/2**. This template is titled **\u201cAccepted Offers for Review\u201d** and draws its content from the **Full Application PDF** document source. When populating the batch, the system will apply the template to the list named **\u201cOffer Accepted.\u201d**",
